Z||000002||286SE'S||07-14-2000||07:06 PM||||The seat covers seem to be a synthetic (polyester) blend as the few burns on mine appear to be more of a melted spot. It will be very difficult to get dye to stick to a synthetic fabric. I would stay with trying to find another seat bottom. The junkyards only seem to charge a few bucks if you pull the cover off and just buy that. I can't say that I have ever seen that color combo before. What year and model did they come off of?<BR>Terry||||reg||1
